# Line endings: LF in the repository, whatever the platform. Without this, a tool that rewrites a
# file with CRLF shows up as a whole-file diff (see b6533c4, which is 5 real lines plus 3000 lines
# of line-ending churn). Godot reads LF fine on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never inspect or normalise these.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.ttf binary
*.glb binary
*.obj binary
*.mtl binary
